    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready your guild. Shape your destiny.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Hall Simulator, a guild in rubble, can't remain as a guild in rubble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guild Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your perfect guild hall:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Place crafting stations, taverns, research labs, and training grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Optimize your layout to empower your adventurers and boost quest success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock adventurers' hidden potential by matching the right hero to the right quest \u2014 from humble G rank missions to elite SSS ranked challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/e954d80efae22f67ddd462ed3f1f0b2f.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/e954d80efae22f67ddd462ed3f1f0b2f.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/e954d80efae22f67ddd462ed3f1f0b2f.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from <strong>zero fame and no gold</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Set item prices and manage your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grow your guild\u2019s economy carefully \u2014 even when pressure rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Balance risk and reward: will you prioritize fame, fortune, or survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/6e98875d111d33c2901e4f8e46c4713b.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/6e98875d111d33c2901e4f8e46c4713b.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/6e98875d111d33c2901e4f8e46c4713b.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/ae867fe71aed6460c0c962e5955d45f7.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/ae867fe71aed6460c0c962e5955d45f7.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/ae867fe71aed6460c0c962e5955d45f7.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Adventure Continues HERE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rebuild</strong> your guild from rubble in an abandoned town. <br>\u2022 <strong>Gather</strong> materials through mining, farming, and logging. <br>\u2022 <strong>Craft</strong> rare weapons, forge armor, and brew powerful potions. <br>\u2022 <strong>Train</strong> weaker adventurers to meet quest requirements. <br>\u2022 <strong>Defend</strong> your guild and town against monster attacks. <br>\u2022 <strong>Automate</strong> your operations to run a thriving guild hall \u2014 even while adventurers eat, drink, and celebrate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/8505c3837a22253a4f6a319706bf596e.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/8505c3837a22253a4f6a319706bf596e.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/8505c3837a22253a4f6a319706bf596e.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/598e47569460aed43eec47a75147fbec.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/598e47569460aed43eec47a75147fbec.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/598e47569460aed43eec47a75147fbec.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will your guild rise as the last beacon of hope - or collapse under the weight of ambition?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, Guild Master.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready your guild. Shape your destiny.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Hall Simulator, a guild in rubble, can't remain as a guild in rubble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guild Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your perfect guild hall:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Place crafting stations, taverns, research labs, and training grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Optimize your layout to empower your adventurers and boost quest success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock adventurers' hidden potential by matching the right hero to the right quest \u2014 from humble G rank missions to elite SSS ranked challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/e954d80efae22f67ddd462ed3f1f0b2f.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/e954d80efae22f67ddd462ed3f1f0b2f.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/e954d80efae22f67ddd462ed3f1f0b2f.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from <strong>zero fame and no gold</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Set item prices and manage your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grow your guild\u2019s economy carefully \u2014 even when pressure rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Balance risk and reward: will you prioritize fame, fortune, or survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/6e98875d111d33c2901e4f8e46c4713b.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/6e98875d111d33c2901e4f8e46c4713b.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/6e98875d111d33c2901e4f8e46c4713b.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/ae867fe71aed6460c0c962e5955d45f7.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/ae867fe71aed6460c0c962e5955d45f7.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/ae867fe71aed6460c0c962e5955d45f7.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Adventure Continues HERE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rebuild</strong> your guild from rubble in an abandoned town. <br>\u2022 <strong>Gather</strong> materials through mining, farming, and logging. <br>\u2022 <strong>Craft</strong> rare weapons, forge armor, and brew powerful potions. <br>\u2022 <strong>Train</strong> weaker adventurers to meet quest requirements. <br>\u2022 <strong>Defend</strong> your guild and town against monster attacks. <br>\u2022 <strong>Automate</strong> your operations to run a thriving guild hall \u2014 even while adventurers eat, drink, and celebrate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/8505c3837a22253a4f6a319706bf596e.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/8505c3837a22253a4f6a319706bf596e.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/8505c3837a22253a4f6a319706bf596e.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/598e47569460aed43eec47a75147fbec.poster.avif?t=1754169934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/598e47569460aed43eec47a75147fbec.webm?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711450/extras/598e47569460aed43eec47a75147fbec.mp4?t=1754169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will your guild rise as the last beacon of hope - or collapse under the weight of ambition?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, Guild Master.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build your guild. Shape your story. In Guild Hall Simulator, you don't slay dragons \u2014 you send others to do it. Manage gold, assign quests, upgrade your hall, and wrangle rowdy adventurers who drink too much. Will your guild rise to fame...or collapse under a mountain of paperwork (and slimes)?",
